我有一个关于和其他演员接吻的问题。

294
00:14:57.900 --> 00:15:01.660
And we have a team here at Earwolf that helps us with that, and we so appreciate it.
你是如何准备和朋友接吻，但又没有浪漫关系的人拍吻戏的？

295
00:15:02.160 --> 00:15:06.720
All right, well, our next question, Jenna, comes from Julie Weiss, and she says,
这会尴尬吗？

