这总是很尴尬。

299
00:15:18.140 --> 00:15:19.360
Oh, Julie.
这总是很尴尬。

300
00:15:22.780 --> 00:15:24.840
Julie, it's always awkward.
这总是很尴尬。

301
00:15:25.060 --> 00:15:26.160
It's always awkward.
这总是很尴尬。

302
00:15:26.460 --> 00:15:30.980
And thank goodness over the years, though, you do become such good friends that it's just like,
好在这些年来，你们确实成了很好的朋友，以至于你会觉得，

303
00:15:31.100 --> 00:15:33.480
okay, well, we'll just do this really quickly.
好吧，我们赶紧把这事儿做了吧。

