00:38:12.630 --> 00:38:13.110
Eventually?
最终？

773
00:38:13.550 --> 00:38:15.610
Again, what happened in Michael's childhood?
再说一次，迈克尔的童年到底发生了什么？

774
00:38:15.830 --> 00:38:18.030
