00:38:57.790 --> 00:39:01.370
us as particularly funny in the moment and we couldn't get over it.
以至于我们久久不能忘怀。

790
00:39:01.510 --> 00:39:03.690
And cash basket was one of them.
而现金礼篮就是其中之一。

791
00:39:04.390 --> 00:39:11.690
I think if my memory serves, Angela, there was a take where Ed was maybe late to saying
如果我没记错的话，安吉拉，当时有一条拍摄，艾德可能在说

792
00:39:11.690 --> 00:39:12.630
cash basket.
现金礼篮时慢了半拍。

793
00:39:12.850 --> 00:39:14.210
And so it came out like this.
所以出来的效果是这样的。

794
00:39:14.630 --> 00:39:15.650
Cash basket.
现金……礼篮。

795
00:39:16.490 --> 00:39:18.910
And that made John Krasinski lose it.
那让约翰·卡拉辛斯基彻底笑场了。

796
00:39:19.090 --> 00:39:22.490
Well, I think it was the very first take and a few things happened.
嗯，我觉得那是第一条拍摄，当时发生了几件事。

797
00:39:22.490 --> 00:39:25.350
