00:39:26.930 --> 00:39:29.850
So it kind of took all of us off guard.
所以这让我们所有人都措手不及。

801
00:39:30.270 --> 00:39:34.930
And John was like right there next to him when Ed was like, cash basket.
当时埃德说了句“现金篮子”，约翰就坐在他旁边。

802
00:39:36.190 --> 00:39:37.810
And we just lost it.
我们当时直接笑喷了。

803
00:39:37.910 --> 00:39:40.270
But John really, he really lost it.
但约翰是真的，他真的笑得不行了。

804
00:39:40.850 --> 00:39:45.870
I watched really closely because I was surprised they had a reaction shot of John at all in
我观察得很仔细，因为我很惊讶他们竟然给约翰留了反应镜头，

