00:39:45.870 --> 00:39:50.250
this scene because my memory of doing this scene was that John was on the floor in tears
在这一幕里，因为我记忆中拍这一幕时，约翰全程都笑得瘫倒在地上，

806
00:39:50.250 --> 00:39:54.630
laughing the entire time because he couldn't get past cash basket.
根本没法跨过“现金篮子”这个梗。

807
00:39:54.870 --> 00:39:59.270
Well, I did notice though, because I was looking as well, he kind of is swiveling his
不过我确实注意到了，因为我也在看，他转动着椅子，

