chair around, but he glances back towards Andy and that is just John looking at Ed.
但他回头瞥向安迪，那纯粹是约翰在看埃德。

809
00:40:06.570 --> 00:40:09.530
That is not Jim looking at Andy.
那不是吉姆在看安迪。

810
00:40:09.530 --> 00:40:13.250
He just has this look of like, man, like this guy is killing me today.
他那种眼神就像是，天哪，这家伙今天快把我笑死了。

811
00:40:14.270 --> 00:40:19.910
