这根本不现实。

823
00:40:54.470 --> 00:40:57.230
Really and truly, that partition came up to my forehead.
真的，那隔板高度都到我额头了。

824
00:40:57.230 --> 00:41:02.110
And I would have to stand on my tippy toes to get my eyeballs over it to talk to Jenna.
我得踮起脚尖，眼睛才能越过隔板跟珍娜说话。

