1530
01:14:00.210 --> 01:14:00.690
Yeah.
没错。

1531
01:14:01.370 --> 01:14:02.890
Well, they come back to the office.
之后，他们回到了办公室。

1532
01:14:02.890 --> 01:14:04.210
They storm in.
他们气势汹汹地冲了进来。

1533
01:14:04.750 --> 01:14:13.510
Michael proclaims that this office will no longer be using any new technology of any kind because he drove his car into a lake.
迈克尔宣布办公室以后不再使用任何新技术，因为他把车开进湖里了。

1534
01:14:13.550 --> 01:14:14.430
An effing lake.
一个该死的湖。

1535
01:14:15.970 --> 01:14:18.350
Well, Oscar is like, you did what?
奥斯卡问，你干了什么？

1536
01:14:18.910 --> 01:14:22.990
And he is like, I drove my car into an effing lake.
他说，我把车开进了一个该死的湖里。

1537
01:14:24.330 --> 01:14:25.790
And they bleep it out.
然后节目组把那个词消音了。

1538
01:14:25.950 --> 01:14:27.830
And this was rare.
这种情况很少见。

1539
01:14:28.030 --> 01:14:33.890
We did not do a lot of bleeping on our show, but every once in a while, man, it's just funnier this way.
我们的剧集里很少用消音，但偶尔这样处理确实更好笑。

1540
01:14:34.030 --> 01:14:35.110
It's just funnier this way.
这样确实更好笑。

1541
01:14:35.370 --> 01:14:35.570
Yeah.
没错。

1542
01:14:35.570 --> 01:14:45.270
He also wants everybody to know that unlike technology, gift baskets never endangered anybody's lives, and he basically declares himself triumphant.
他还想让大家知道，与科技不同，礼品篮从未危及任何人的生命，他基本上宣布自己大获全胜。

1543
01:14:45.270 --> 01:14:46.370
Yes, he does.
没错，他确实这么说了。

1544
01:14:46.590 --> 01:14:53.490
And there's a very big Angela Martin eye roll at 40 minutes, 43 seconds as Michael declares himself the winner.
在40分43秒时，当迈克尔宣布自己获胜时，安吉拉·马丁翻了一个巨大的白眼。

1545
01:14:53.650 --> 01:14:55.550
But he doesn't just declare himself the winner.
但他不仅仅是宣布自己获胜。

1546
01:14:55.670 --> 01:14:56.470
This is what he says.
他是这么说的。

1547
01:14:56.850 --> 01:15:01.410
To Ryan, his new boss, he says, game, set, match.
他对新老板瑞安说，局、盘、赛，全赢。

1548
01:15:01.810 --> 01:15:03.010
Point, Scott.
斯科特得分。

1549
01:15:03.430 --> 01:15:04.230
Game over.
游戏结束。

1550
01:15:04.930 --> 01:15:05.950
End of game.
比赛终结。

1551
01:15:05.950 --> 01:15:08.910
And then he tries one more, but he can't think of it.
然后他又试了一次，但他想不起来了。

1552
01:15:08.990 --> 01:15:10.490
So then he just walks into his office.
于是他就直接走进了办公室。

1553
01:15:12.970 --> 01:15:14.050
It's so good.
太棒了。

1554
01:15:14.530 --> 01:15:16.010
It is so good.
真的太棒了。

1555
01:15:17.690 --> 01:15:25.290
Michael ends it all with a final talking head, and we see all of us eating from the gift basket in the conference room.
迈克尔以最后一段采访结束了这一集，我们看到大家都在会议室里吃着礼品篮里的东西。

1556
01:15:25.450 --> 01:15:26.770
I remember shooting that scene.
我记得拍那场戏的时候。

1557
01:15:27.250 --> 01:15:27.650
Remember?
还记得吗？

1558
01:15:27.890 --> 01:15:28.070
Yeah.
记得。

1559
01:15:28.190 --> 01:15:35.410
We shot the scene earlier where we were looking at all the things, and I remembered, I can't wait until we do the scene where I get to eat all this.
我们早些时候拍了那场戏，当时我们看着所有的东西，我就想，我等不及要拍我们吃这些东西的戏份了。

1560
01:15:35.530 --> 01:15:36.890
I was not in the conference room.
我当时不在会议室里。

1561
01:15:36.990 --> 01:15:38.390
Angela's having none of it.
安吉拉对此一点也不感兴趣。

1562
01:15:39.050 --> 01:15:39.430
Yeah.
是啊。

1563
01:15:39.630 --> 01:15:42.370
It's too bad because there were some good stuff.
太可惜了，因为里面有些好东西。

1564
01:15:42.370 --> 01:15:42.650
I know.
我知道。

1565
01:15:42.790 --> 01:15:47.130
I remember you guys were actually excited in real life to open up those packages.
我记得你们在现实生活中确实很兴奋能打开那些包装。

1566
01:15:48.170 --> 01:15:52.390
And then ultimately we end the episode with a Ryan talking head.
最后，我们以瑞安的采访结束了这一集。

1567
01:15:53.270 --> 01:15:58.130
He's still gloating about his new schmancy life.
他还在为自己那奢华的新生活沾沾自喜。

1568
01:15:58.350 --> 01:16:05.270
He says, you know, he's not saying he had a meteoric rise, but, you know, but I guess he did, and that his haircut was $200.
他说，你知道，他不是说自己平步青云，但，你知道，我想他确实是，而且他的发型花了200美元。

1569
01:16:06.670 --> 01:16:08.150
He's just being such a tool.
他真是个十足的蠢货。

1570
01:16:08.150 --> 01:16:15.070
And, lady, there are some great extras in the deleted scenes of Ryan bragging about New York.
而且，女士，在瑞安吹嘘纽约的删减片段里，有一些很棒的额外内容。

1571
01:16:15.270 --> 01:16:19.630
He has a whole thing with Jim about, like, well, you know, in New York.
他和吉姆有一整段对话，大概是说，嗯，你知道，在纽约。

1572
01:16:19.710 --> 01:16:21.510
And Jim's like, yeah, I actually – I've been there.
吉姆说，是啊，其实——我去过那里。

1573
01:16:21.530 --> 01:16:23.070
And he's like, no, no, no, but it's different.
然后他说，不，不，不，但那是不一样的。

1574
01:16:23.090 --> 01:16:24.330
You've got to live there.
你得住在那里才行。

1575
01:16:24.510 --> 01:16:27.590
Like, you don't – you can't really understand what I'm talking about because you haven't lived there.
就像，你没——你没法真正理解我在说什么，因为你没在那里住过。

1576
01:16:27.710 --> 01:16:28.490
So, you know, sorry.
所以，你知道，抱歉。

1577
01:16:29.530 --> 01:16:29.890
Yeah.
是啊。

1578
01:16:30.130 --> 01:16:31.470
But anyway, they're really funny.
但不管怎样，它们真的很有趣。

1579
01:16:31.650 --> 01:16:32.370
It's too bad.
太可惜了。

1580
01:16:32.750 --> 01:16:34.770
I really loved the scene between him and Jim.
我真的很喜欢他和吉姆之间的那场戏。

1581
01:16:34.770 --> 01:16:36.170
He just would not let it go.
他就是不肯罢休。

1582
01:16:36.170 --> 01:16:37.970
Well, that's it, guys.
好了，就这样了，伙计们。

1583
01:16:38.850 --> 01:16:41.610
That finishes out Dunder Mifflin Infinity.
这一集《邓德·米夫林无限公司》就到此结束了。

1584
01:16:42.250 --> 01:16:43.670
Dunder Mifflin Infinity.
《邓德·米夫林无限公司》。

1585
