Lunch party.
午餐派对。

1589
01:16:49.510 --> 01:16:50.590
Launch party.
发布会派对。

1590
01:16:50.990 --> 01:16:51.430
Kevin.
凯文。

1591
01:16:51.470 --> 01:16:52.310
Well, it's a party.
嗯，这就是个派对。

1592
01:16:52.550 --> 01:16:53.290
Launch party.
发布会派对。

1593
01:16:53.310 --> 01:16:53.570
It's a party.
这就是个派对。

1594
01:16:55.610 --> 01:16:56.630
All right, guys.
好了，伙计们。

1595
01:16:56.650 --> 01:16:57.850
We'll see you next week.
我们下周见。

1596
01:16:57.850 --> 01:16:58.490
See you next week.
下周见。

1597
01:16:58.570 --> 01:16:59.310
Have a great one.
祝你们过得愉快。

